 the transition itself.\n    *   (I) Temperature: Temperature is a factor, but even in warm areas, if there's enough water, you'll have forests; if there's little water, you'll have grasslands.\n    *   (J) Altitude: Altitude affects temperature and precipitation, but water availability remains the fundamental driver.\n"}
