thal in the homozygous state.\n\n    *   (G) Heterozygous individuals will show no symptoms. This is the standard explanation for why recessive alleles persist despite being lethal in the homozygous state.\n\n    *   Check (G): \"Heterozygous individuals will show no symptoms.\"\n    *   Wait, let's double-check if there's any other\n"}
