arriving exactly as sent is \"Message Integrity.\"\n\n    *   Integrity: Data has not been changed.\n    *   Confidentiality: Data is kept secret.\n    *   Availability: Data is accessible when needed.\n    *   Authenticity: Source is verified.\n\n    The question asks about the data arriving *exactly as they were sent*, which\n"}
