ust one part of the definition.\n    *   (I) Protection of land: Related to agriculture, not food security itself.\n\n    *   The question asks \"What is food security?\"\n    *   Option (C) lists the standard four pillars: availability, utilization, stability, and access. This is the most academically and internationally accepted definition (e\n"}
