s and food preferences for an active and healthy life.\"\n    *   This definition encompasses the four pillars:\n        1.  *Availability:* Is there enough food?\n        2.  *Access:* Can people get the food?\n        3.  *Utilization:* Is the food nutritious and safe?\n        4.  *Stability:* Is the supply consistent?\n\n    *   Option (C) states: \"Its component elements\n"}
